             max RSS (time -v)             1,584 KB      1,584 KB   0 KB (+0.0%)            NEUTRAL (+/-32 KB)
             image text+data+bss            20.7 KB       20.2 KB   -504 B (-2.4%)          REDUCES
             tracked heap peak             784.0 KB      784.0 KB   0 B (+0.0%)             NEUTRAL
             stack high-water               2,888 B       2,920 B   +32 B (+1.1%)           NEUTRAL
