             off when many processes share them. Measured at N=20,000 (code/runtime-dominated), this
             bounds what the lever can ever save; the process floor alone is 1,088 KB. On an MMU-
             less microcontroller the image change (+569.1 KB (+570.0%)) is paid in full in
             flash/RAM, which Linux demand paging hides. Trade-off: image text+data+bss INCREASES
             (+569.1 KB (+570.0%)).
