             file on disk (info)            72.0 KB       72.0 KB
             minor faults (info)                283           283
             run time (info)                0.000 s       0.000 s
  OUTCOME   : INCREASES (stack only)   hypothesis INCREASES -> CONFIRMED   output: n/a (different algorithm/type)
  MEANING   : 'depth=14' raises stack high-water by 2,432 B (33.3%) versus 'depth=10'. Resident
             memory on Linux did not move measurably because demand paging only charges pages that
             are touched and RSS is counted in whole pages. Each level keeps two local history
             arrays (~0.5 KB) alive; stack grows linearly with depth while run time grows 16x.
             Unbounded recursion has no place in firmware. Measured at N=20,000 (code/runtime-
             dominated), this bounds what the lever can ever save; the process floor alone is 1,088
             KB.
