  MEANING   : No memory dimension moved beyond measurement noise (RSS threshold +/-32 KB). At -O2 the
             tail call becomes a jump: stack is constant in the horizon. The same source at -O0 uses
             one frame per step (see S-05) -- the stack bound depends on the build flags, so it must
             be verified for the shipping configuration. Measured at N=20,000 (code/runtime-
             dominated), this bounds what the lever can ever save; the process floor alone is 1,088
             KB.
